#1204
The Board Room Of The Immortals~
   This large room is well-decorated, and lit from above by a soft, magical
glow of no particular origin. Scattered around the room are comfortable chairs
and piles of furs of various dimension, and in the very middle there is a huge
oaken table that shimmers in an odd manner. A large picture window looks down
over the whole world, showing the exploits of the many intrepid mortals. A
spiral staircase leads down to another part of this room. There is a sign
hovering in the awesomeness of this room.
~
