#1210
A Burning Hut~
   You stand inside a burning hut; what you considered home until a few
moments ago when the orcs entered the village. You slept soundly until it was
too late; only the horrified screams of your parents dying woke you.
Now you stand bravely, though petrified with fear in your mind, as you watch
the hairy, tusked orcs advance toward you, swords in hand.
~
