#1212
The Beast Lair~
   You didn't have to accept the quest at hand, but yet, somehow you felt
compelled to do so. Now, hugging the far wall of the cavern, you have entered
the beast's lair and been discovered. You stand still, petrified with fear
although years of training allow you to face death with a brave stance. The
beast shuffles towards you with heavy feet, an evil toothy-grin across its
face.
~
