#1221
The City Weaponsmith~
   You've got to be careful navigating your way through the store to avoid
cutting yourself on any number of sharp weapons hanging from the walls and
ceiling. Buried over in the corner is a small counter where you can conduct
your business; alternatively, you could leave via the same way you came in.
~
