#1222
The City Jeweler~
   The wealth displayed in this store alone is almost beyond comprehension -
some of the finest jewels and artifacts from around the realm are displayed
in numerous cases around the room. You can stand here in awe for as long as
you wish, or exit via the same way you came in.
~
