The City Apothecary~
   The aroma of freshly crushed herbs and reagents fills the air and, for a
brief moment, clears your mind of all of your troubles. Shelves on the far
wall contain potions of varying use, most of which appear unfamiliar to you.
The only exit is back via the way you came.
~
