#1226
A Store for the Mystical Arts~
   This store, at least it would appear as one, is quite unlike others you
have seen before. There are no walls, no ceiling and no floor, only darkness -
yet, your feet stand on solid ground and the exit is quite clear. Pulsing
spheres of light dance around the room, almost as if they had a life of their
own...
~
